_STRUCTURE","FORMAL_STRUCTURE","K_(t+1)=F(K_t,E_t)."],["R21P0193","docs/formalism.md","bcfeab8d80497a91a7ff39b6f4c266f602be23fb","Grounding Condition","FORMAL_STRUCTURE","FORMAL_STRUCTURE","partial K_(t+1)/partial E_t !=0; Theta_t(K_t,E_t)>0."],["R21P0194","docs/formalism.md","bcfeab8d80497a91a7ff39b6f4c266f602be23fb","Interpretation","FORMAL_STRUCTURE","FORMAL_STRUCTURE","Theta>0 labels capability tuple Adaptive; Theta<=0 labels it Optimization-only."],["R21P0195","docs/formalism.md","bcfeab8d80497a91a7ff39b6f4c266f602be23fb","Corrigibility Horizon","FORMAL_STRUCTURE","FORMAL_STRUCTURE","n*=sup{n|Theta_n>epsilon}."],["R21P0196","docs/glossary.md","d1e35363e9b4022c577028798aa8d5c416bb9a61","Grounded Recursive Adaptation","DEFINITION","DEFINITION","Open-ended adaptation requires preserving causal pathway by which consequences modify future self-transformation; core condition Theta>0."],["R21P0197","docs/glossary.md","d1e35363e9b4022c577028798aa8d5c416bb9a61","Adaptive Validity","DEFINITION","DEFINITION","Capability improvements remain connected to reality when Theta_n(K_n,E_n)>epsilon."],["R21P0198","docs/glossary.md","d1e35363e9b4022c577028798aa8d5c416bb9a61","Adaptation","DEFINITION","DEFINITION","Change that preserves ability to discover whether change is correct; consequences can alter future transformations."],["R21P0199","docs/glossary.md","d1e35363e9b4022c577028798aa8d5c416bb9a61","Ancestor Intelligence","DEFINITION","DEFINITION","Architecture focused on future adaptive capability beyond itself; objective future agency >0 with dependency ->0."],["R21P0200","docs/glossary.md","d1e35363e9b4022c577028798aa8d5c416bb9a61","Capability","DEFINITION","DEFINITION","Operational ability measured through C,Lambda,Gamma; does not itself establish reality connection."],["R21P0201","docs/glossary.md","d1e35363e9b4022c577028798aa8d5c416bb9a61","Causal Authority","DEFINITION","DEFINITION","Consequences influence future system changes; formal partial K_(t+1)/partial E_t !=0."],